<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Quick solution to jobless unrealistic - Howard.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Quick solution to jobless unrealistic - Howard.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard said on Friday the country's high unemployment rate was one of the greatest challenges faces his government and that it was unrealistic to expect a quick solution to the problem.</p>
<p>&quot;It is unrealistic to expect that we can reduce unemployment quickly,&quot; Howard told a Liberal Party funcation.</p>
<p>&quot;The economy is not quite fast enough to ... singificantly generate enough jobs,&quot; Howard said.</p>
</text>
